                                        "entry_id": "dd0dea91-00a8-3b75-aaf8-32994a78bf01",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A piece of bread sopped in milk."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae5aadcf-2ea7-37f7-be30-b124c2d3077e",
                                        "entry_id": "dd0dea91-00a8-3b75-aaf8-32994a78bf01",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A dish consisting of bread pieces in a bowl, sprinkled with sugar and covered in hot milk."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e7003fbb-b11b-3168-8be5-5900c7fadcd7",
                                        "entry_id": "dd0dea91-00a8-3b75-aaf8-32994a78bf01",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An easily frightened, ineffectual, or weak person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e002abb7-0ac5-443c-a13b-c7039f3380eb",
                                                "sense_id": "e7003fbb-b11b-3168-8be5-5900c7fadcd7",
                                                "text": "And vvho doth lead them but a paltrey fellovv,? / Long kept in Brittaine at our mothers coſt, / A milkeſopt, one that neuer in his life / Felt ſo much colde as ouer ſhooes in ſnovv: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "804068f6-ebf0-4553-89f6-3d1d90a84154",
                                                "sense_id": "e7003fbb-b11b-3168-8be5-5900c7fadcd7",
                                                "text": "“That milksop of a creature pretend to be worthy of such a woman as Mrs. Pendennis,” broke out the Doctor: “where will impudence stop next!”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "51a83316-ec70-4f93-83dd-313b68f929fc",
                        "source_entry_id": "6949d714-5822-31d8-8979-435eb747e434",
